# 必考词 Unit 01 短语

## 常考短语

- **abandon oneself to**: 沉溺于，放纵于 — He abandoned himself to despair after the failure. 失败后他陷入了绝望。
- **be abundant in**: 富有，丰富 — The region is abundant in natural resources. 该地区自然资源丰富。
- **adapt to**: 适应 — She adapted to the new school quickly. 她很快适应了新学校。
- **adhere to**: 坚持，遵守 — We should adhere to the principle of fairness. 我们应坚持公平原则。
- **adjust to**: 调整以适应 — It takes time to adjust to a new culture. 适应新文化需要时间。
- **in advance**: 预先，提前 — Please let me know in advance if you can't come. 如果你不能来，请提前告诉我。
- **take advantage of**: 利用 — We should take advantage of every opportunity to learn. 我们应该利用每一个学习的机会。
- **be alert to**: 对…保持警觉 — Drivers should be alert to road conditions. 驾驶员应对路况保持警觉。
- **allocate...to...**: 把…分配给… — The company allocated more resources to research. 公司把更多资源分配给了研究。
- **accommodate oneself to**: 使自己适应 — You must accommodate yourself to the new rules. 你必须适应新规则。
- **accomplish nothing**: 一事无成 — Without hard work, you will accomplish nothing. 不努力工作，你将一事无成。
- **accumulate experience**: 积累经验 — She accumulated years of experience in teaching. 她积累了多年的教学经验。
- **acknowledge...as**: 承认…为 — He is acknowledged as an expert in the field. 他被公认为该领域的专家。
- **adopt a policy**: 采取政策 — The school adopted a new anti-bullying policy. 学校采取了新的反欺凌政策。
- **advocate doing sth**: 提倡做某事 — He advocates using public transport. 他提倡使用公共交通。
- **be affected by**: 受…影响 — The crops were severely affected by the drought. 农作物受到了干旱的严重影响。
